{"script": "scenario_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 0, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「瓜生君，今天櫻乃不來嗎？」", "text_idx": 375, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 404, "voice": "ar0484", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 1, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「這我也不清楚，因為她也不是事前會報備的那種女孩。」", "text_idx": 382, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 409, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 2, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那傳郵件給她吧……問她今天要不要來這裡吃午飯。」", "text_idx": 385, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 404, "voice": "ar0485", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 3, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "瀨名同學今天也是到了午休時間，就自己走到我的座位附近。", "text_idx": 412, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 4, "speaker": "結女生徒Ａ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「瀨名同學，妳從昨天起就跟瓜生君他們一起吃飯呢～」", "text_idx": 373, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": "結女學生A", "alt_speaker_idx": 422, "voice": "ja0028", "char_id": "結女生徒Ａ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 5, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "──這個變化，也已經在班上的同學心中留下了印象。", "text_idx": 315, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 6, "speaker": "結女生徒Ｂ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「這是怎樣的心境轉變呢？」", "text_idx": 383, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "結女學生B", "alt_speaker_idx": 423, "voice": "jb0017", "char_id": "結女生徒Ｂ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 7, "speaker": "結女生徒Ａ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不過總而言之，氣氛好像變輕鬆了。老實說之前有點怕瀨名同學……」", "text_idx": 321, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 32, "alt_speaker": "結女學生A", "alt_speaker_idx": 422, "voice": "ja0029", "char_id": "結女生徒Ａ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 8, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "（盯……）", "text_idx": 434, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 404, "voice": "ar0486", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 9, "speaker": "結女生徒Ａ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊、我、我什麼都沒說啦呵呵呵呵！」", "text_idx": 341, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "結女學生A", "alt_speaker_idx": 422, "voice": "ja0030", "char_id": "結女生徒Ａ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 10, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "瀨名同學原本是最強硬反對合併的人。", "text_idx": 414, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 11, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "結女學生們即使後來漸漸接受，她們還是會在意瀨名同學的想法。", "text_idx": 424, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 12, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "在各種意義上，她都是結女學生們的代表。以我的感覺來說，就是「窗」。", "text_idx": 399, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 33, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 13, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "所以其中的難處一直持續到了上週……", "text_idx": 408, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 14, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「都已經這樣了，只能去習慣吧。而且態度再曖昧下去反而彆扭……」", "text_idx": 386, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 31, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 404, "voice": "ar0487", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 15, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不管實情為何，她展現出的態度轉變讓教室內的氣氛輕鬆了不少。", "text_idx": 392, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 16, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「哎呀，愛理也終於學會對人溫柔了呢。」", "text_idx": 337, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 421, "voice": "sn0062", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 17, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "乾同學安慰了被瀨名同學瞪的其他同學。", "text_idx": 395, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 18, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "然後和經常來我們教室的天羽學姊撒嬌。", "text_idx": 415, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 19, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「怎麼這樣啊紗凪，把我說得像是冷酷的人一樣。」", "text_idx": 363, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 404, "voice": "ar0488", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 20, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「哎呀～到上週為止的愛理就像北風一樣喔！但是這下總算追上我了的感覺？」", "text_idx": 338, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 35, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 421, "voice": "sn0063", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 21, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「喔喔，小紗同學是俯視人的態度！」", "text_idx": 349, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 402, "voice": "ag0261", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 22, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「呵呵呵，那小紗凪就是太陽囉？」", "text_idx": 334, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 427, "voice": "mu0159", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 23, "speaker": "ぱんにゃ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嚕？嚕～」", "text_idx": 354, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "熊喵", "alt_speaker_idx": 416, "voice": "pn0055", "char_id": "ぱんにゃ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 24, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不過小乾好相處、瀨名同學比較兇的感覺也是真的～」", "text_idx": 320, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 431, "voice": "ht0154", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 25, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "（盯。）", "text_idx": 435, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 404, "voice": "ar0489", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 26, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「現在就是北風在吹了。」", "text_idx": 374, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 409, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 27, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「哼，隨便你們說。」", "text_idx": 340, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 404, "voice": "ar0490", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 28, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "瀨名同學冷淡地把臉轉向旁邊。", "text_idx": 413, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 29, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "另一邊，乾同學越來越得意地挺起胸。", "text_idx": 397, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 30, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「所以？妳還想說什麼嗎，紗凪？」", "text_idx": 367, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 404, "voice": "ar0491", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 31, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「對人溫柔……對男生也溫柔……我覺得果然要這樣才對。愛理也終於瞭解到了呢。」", "text_idx": 361, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 38, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 421, "voice": "sn0064", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 32, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「喔喔喔！原來如此！關於這一點想麻煩妳說得再詳細一點呢～」", "text_idx": 348, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 402, "voice": "ag0262", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 33, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「對吧對吧？就是這樣～」", "text_idx": 362, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 421, "voice": "sn0065", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 34, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "因為安潔的附和，乾同學氣勢正盛。", "text_idx": 398, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 35, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「愛理最近跟美羽學姊也很要好，果然這也可以說是美羽學姊的功勞對吧！」", "text_idx": 364, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 34, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 421, "voice": "sn0066", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 36, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我做了什麼嗎？」", "text_idx": 366, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 427, "voice": "mu0160", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 37, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "突然被點到名，天羽學姊睜大了眼睛。", "text_idx": 420, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 38, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「哎～呀～在說什麼呢～愛理此時的改邪歸正絕對是被漂浮在美羽學姊周圍的溫柔分子的影響喔～♪」", "text_idx": 339, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 45, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 421, "voice": "sn0067", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 39, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 316, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 404, "voice": "ar0492", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 40, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "雖然瀨名同學冷靜地聽著她說……", "text_idx": 433, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 41, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "畢竟乾同學一開始對我們男生就很友善，而且她最喜歡天羽學姊了。", "text_idx": 417, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 42, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "她會說是因為天羽學姊的影響變成溫柔的性格……這也不是不能理解。", "text_idx": 400, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 31, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 43, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「連熊喵也是最喜歡學姊了對吧？」", "text_idx": 384, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 409, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 44, "speaker": "ぱんにゃ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嚕♪嚕♪」", "text_idx": 352, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "熊喵", "alt_speaker_idx": 416, "voice": "pn0056", "char_id": "ぱんにゃ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 45, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我戳了戳趴在天羽學姊頭上的熊喵。", "text_idx": 406, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 46, "speaker": "ぱんにゃ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗚嚕～～♪」", "text_idx": 350, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "熊喵", "alt_speaker_idx": 416, "voice": "pn0057", "char_id": "ぱんにゃ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 47, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「呵呵，小熊喵也最喜歡瓜生君了呢。」", "text_idx": 335, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 427, "voice": "mu0161", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 48, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "看到熊喵開心的樣子，天羽學姊溫柔地笑了。", "text_idx": 418, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 49, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "（盯……）", "text_idx": 434, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 427, "voice": "mu0162", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 50, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊，那個……？」", "text_idx": 344, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 409, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 51, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯！吶小紗凪，我覺得是多虧了瓜生君的人望喔？」", "text_idx": 351, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 427, "voice": "mu0163", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 52, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「欸？」", "text_idx": 371, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 421, "voice": "sn0068", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 53, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「因為這麼短的時間裡就跟小熊喵要好了嘛。我認為小愛理一定也覺得瓜生君是個優秀的男孩子吧。」", "text_idx": 357, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 45, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 427, "voice": "mu0164", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 54, "speaker": "汎用２", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「呃，我沒有……」「……」", "text_idx": 331, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "愛理／紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 405, "voice": "go036", "char_id": "汎用２"}]}
{"script": "scenario_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 55, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "被誇到這種程度，我不知道該擺出怎樣的表情……", "text_idx": 429, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 56, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「興奮興奮！」", "text_idx": 379, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 402, "voice": "ag0263", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 57, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「對了，你要不要再考慮一下加入喵喵社呢，瓜生君？」", "text_idx": 360, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 427, "voice": "mu0165", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 58, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「欸？呃……」", "text_idx": 372, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 409, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 59, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「如果瓜生君願意加入的話就好了，我真的是這麼想的喔。」", "text_idx": 359, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 427, "voice": "mu0166", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 60, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "雖然很高興她這麼說，但這不是簡單就能回答的事……", "text_idx": 432, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 61, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「總之，現在還是只能說不好意思──」", "text_idx": 376, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 409, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 62, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "──嗯？", "text_idx": 314, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 63, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「乾同學？」", "text_idx": 322, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 409, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 64, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……瓜生。」", "text_idx": 317, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 421, "voice": "sn0072", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 65, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「！？」", "text_idx": 388, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 409, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 66, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "突、突然就直呼我的名字了……", "text_idx": 419, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 67, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「喂混帳瓜生！不准你再接近美羽學姊了～～～～！」", "text_idx": 347, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 421, "voice": "sn0073", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 68, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「欸欸欸欸！？」", "text_idx": 370, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 409, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 69, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊～！啊～！果然男生就是這樣、就是這樣！對你們溫柔是我錯了！！」", "text_idx": 346, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 33, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 421, "voice": "sn0074", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 70, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不准碰我的美羽學姊你這隻渣蟲！啊啊當然也不准碰我！」", "text_idx": 318, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 421, "voice": "sn0075", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 71, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「被男生這種變態生物碰到會懷孕的啊──────！！！」", "text_idx": 380, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 421, "voice": "sn0076", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 72, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我被劈頭罵了一頓後愣在原地。", "text_idx": 407, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 73, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "……那個友善的乾同學在我眼前瞬間人格大變，大吼大叫著暴露出心中對男生的厭惡……", "text_idx": 312, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 39, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 74, "speaker": "結女生徒Ａ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊～紗凪的面具終於脫落了……」", "text_idx": 345, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "結女學生A", "alt_speaker_idx": 422, "voice": "ja0031", "char_id": "結女生徒Ａ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 75, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「應該說真虧她能撐到今天呢……明明就那麼討厭男生的說……」", "text_idx": 365, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 404, "voice": "ar0494", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 76, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「欸、是這樣嗎！？」", "text_idx": 369, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 409, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 77, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「雖然不知道原因，不過她好像從合併試辦開始就一直戴著假面具喔……」", "text_idx": 387, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 33, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 404, "voice": "ar0495", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 78, "speaker": "結女生徒Ａ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「但果然還是脫落了……早晚要發生的事總算發生了的感覺吧。」", "text_idx": 324, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": "結女學生A", "alt_speaker_idx": 422, "voice": "ja0032", "char_id": "結女生徒Ａ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 79, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「因為知道原本的她，所以說實話我們都覺得挺詭異的呢。」", "text_idx": 356, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 402, "voice": "ag0265", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 80, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "好像就是這麼一回事。", "text_idx": 401, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 81, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「因為瀨名同學變成這樣……是嗎新吾？」", "text_idx": 355, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 431, "voice": "ht0155", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 82, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 316, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 409, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 83, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "沒錯。變得能跟瀨名同學正常對話後才過了沒多久……", "text_idx": 411, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 84, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「呵呵，小紗凪真有精神呢～」", "text_idx": 336, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 427, "voice": "mu0167", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 85, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「你給我記住混帳瓜生～～～～～～～！！」", "text_idx": 328, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 421, "voice": "sn0078", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 86, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "就像取代瀨名同學一樣，這次是乾同學對我展現出了強烈的敵意。", "text_idx": 403, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 87, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "──合併試辦真是每一天都高潮迭起啊。", "text_idx": 313, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 88, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不過。", "text_idx": 393, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 3, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 89, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「美羽學姊、美羽學姊♪」", "text_idx": 377, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 421, "voice": "sn0079", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 90, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「什麼事，小紗凪？」", "text_idx": 323, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 427, "voice": "mu0168", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 91, "speaker": "ぱんにゃ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嚕、嚕、嗚嚕～♪」", "text_idx": 353, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "熊喵", "alt_speaker_idx": 416, "voice": "pn0058", "char_id": "ぱんにゃ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 92, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「好好好，乖乖。」", "text_idx": 358, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 409, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 93, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊，謝謝你陪小熊喵玩喔，瓜生君。」", "text_idx": 343, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 427, "voice": "mu0169", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 94, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不會不會。」", "text_idx": 319, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 409, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 95, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「你怎麼會在這裡啊快點消失，去去去！不要打擾我跟學姊的親親熱熱時光啦，電燈泡！」", "text_idx": 326, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 40, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 421, "voice": "sn0080", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 96, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "關鍵的天羽學姊對我的態度沒有絲毫改變，乾同學又想待在學姊身邊……", "text_idx": 430, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 32, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 97, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "先不說立場，反正我們各自的定位都沒有改變，那就這樣吧。", "text_idx": 396, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 98, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「你、你在看什麼？該不會是迷上我了？男生一看到可愛的女孩就會這樣，真是討厭討厭。」", "text_idx": 325, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 41, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 421, "voice": "sn0081", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 99, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「呃，我沒有那個意思。」", "text_idx": 332, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 409, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 100, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「你是說我不可愛嗎！」", "text_idx": 327, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 421, "voice": "sn0082", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 101, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊哈哈，我也不是那個意思啦。」", "text_idx": 342, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 409, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 102, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「到底是怎樣啦，笨蛋！給我說清楚！」", "text_idx": 329, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 421, "voice": "sn0083", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 103, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「美羽學姊，瓜生這個混帳盡說些曖昧的話欺負我～」", "text_idx": 378, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 421, "voice": "sn0084", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 104, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「呵呵呵，你們兩個都好有趣喔。」", "text_idx": 333, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 427, "voice": "mu0170", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 105, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "而且比起以前對話氣氛反倒更熱鬧了。", "text_idx": 428, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 106, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「這也是好事吧。」", "text_idx": 381, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 409, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 107, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "乾同學也不再勉強自己，用她最自然的一面跟我相處。", "text_idx": 394, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 108, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「是說你到底要在這裡待到什麼時候！真的快點給我消失啦，從這個世界上！」", "text_idx": 368, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 35, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 421, "voice": "sn0085", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 109, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「只要有我在，絕對不會讓像你這樣的混帳傢伙接近學姊！」", "text_idx": 330, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 421, "voice": "sn0086", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 110, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "……呃，果然我的前途還是感覺多災多難。", "text_idx": 311, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
